				(property "Description" "Small-signal N-channel MOSFET, level shift for the winch kill gate. Pin order G-S-D to match SOT-23. Pulls the P-FET gate down through R35 when the Teensy asserts the kill line; R36 holds it off while the MCU is in reset or high-Z."
